{"id":"f3ad34116c96ab00","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-jordan-decomposition.md","title":"Jordan Decomposition","display":"df-jordan-decomposition — Jordan Decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jordan-decomposition","aliases":["58-df-jordan-decomposition"],"display":"df-jordan-decomposition — Jordan Decomposition","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-singular-measures.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jordan-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jordan-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jordan-decomposition — Jordan Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md\">../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f7d817d22ccbf755\" href=\"?note=f7d817d22ccbf755\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-singular-measures.md\">../batch01/58-df-singular-measures.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,|\\mu|\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,|\\mu|\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md\">../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalVariation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalVariation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\">\\(\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\)</span> denotes the total-variation norm when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mu|(X)&lt;\\infty\">\\(|\\mu|(X)&lt;\\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mu(A)=\\mu^+(A)-\\mu^-(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mu(A)=\\mu^+(A)-\\mu^-(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalVariation}_S(|\\mu|,\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mu|(A)=\\mu^+(A)+\\mu^-(A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalVariation}_S(|\\mu|,\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mu|(A)=\\mu^+(A)+\\mu^-(A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n|\\mu|(X)&lt;\\infty\\to\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\coloneqq|\\mu|(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n|\\mu|(X)&lt;\\infty\\to\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\coloneqq|\\mu|(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Jordan pair is unique. Total variation is first a positive measure; its value on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is the norm only for finite signed measures.</li>\n<li>The partition formula takes a supremum over finite measurable partitions of each measurable set, not an arbitrary unbounded index family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-singular-measures.md","status":"resolved","id":"f7d817d22ccbf755","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-singular-measures.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,|\\mu|\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalVariation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mu|(X)<\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mu(A)=\\mu^+(A)-\\mu^-(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalVariation}_S(|\\mu|,\\mu,\\mu^+,\\mu^-,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{JordanDecomp}_S(\\mu^+,\\mu^-,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mu|(A)=\\mu^+(A)+\\mu^-(A)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n|\\mu|(X)<\\infty\\to\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\coloneqq|\\mu|(X).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1927,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-723","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-jordan-decomposition.md|58-df-jordan-decomposition]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","ca832ed6bc22f728","f7d817d22ccbf755"]}